{"content": [{"id": "62cd444d", "settings": {"flex_direction": "column", "content_width": "full", "margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "padding": {"unit": "%", "top": "3", "right": "15", "bottom": "10", "left": "15", "isLinked": false}, "padding_widescreen": {"unit": "%", "top": "", "right": "", "bottom": "", "left": "", "isLinked": true}, "padding_tablet": {"unit": "%", "top": "", "right": "", "bottom": "", "left": "", "isLinked": true}, "padding_mobile": {"unit": "%", "top": "5", "right": "5", "bottom": "5", "left": "5", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "121e9de", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "width": {"unit": "%", "size": 70}, "width_tablet": {"unit": "%", "size": "", "sizes": []}, "width_mobile": {"unit": "%", "size": "", "sizes": []}, "boxed_width": {"unit": "px", "size": 500, "sizes": []}, "min_height": {"unit": "px", "size": 100, "sizes": []}, "background_background": "gradient", "background_color": "#FFFFFF", "background_color_b": "#FFFFFF80", "border_radius": {"unit": "px", "top": "20", "right": "20", "bottom": "20", "left": "20", "isLinked": true}, "margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "20", "right": "20", "bottom": "20", "left": "20", "isLinked": false}, "_transform_scale_popover": "transform", "_transform_keep_proportions": "", "_transform_scale_effect": {"unit": "px", "size": 0.9, "sizes": []}, "_transform_scale_popover_hover": "transform", "_transform_scale_effect_hover": {"unit": "px", "size": 0.9, "sizes": []}, "_element_width": "initial", "eael_wrapper_link": {"url": "/single-services", "is_external": "", "nofollow": "", "custom_attributes": ""}, "background_color_stop": {"unit": "%", "size": 50, "sizes": []}, "flex_gap": {"column": "20", "row": "20", "isLinked": true, "unit": "px", "size": 20}, "_flex_size": "grow", "flex_justify_content": "center", "flex_align_items": "center", "_flex_align_self": "center"}, "elements": [{"id": "216e06d", "settings": {"title": "Hipoteca Puente con Capital Privado", "header_size": "h1", "typography_typography": "custom", "typography_font_family": "Roboto", "typography_font_size": {"unit": "px", "size": 28, "sizes": []}, "typography_font_weight": "300", "title_color": "#598199", "_margin": {"unit": "%", "top": "-2", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "__dynamic__": {"title": "[elementor-tag id=\"36988ea\" name=\"page-title\" settings=\"%7B%7D\"]"}, "_element_width": "initial", "_element_custom_width": {"unit": "%", "size": 100, "sizes": []}, "_margin_tablet": {"unit": "%", "top": "", "right": "", "bottom": "", "left": "", "isLinked": true}, "_margin_mobile": {"unit": "%", "top": "", "right": "", "bottom": "", "left": "", "isLinked": true}, "align": "center", "typography_font_size_mobile": {"unit": "px", "size": 18, "sizes": []}, "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50}, "_id": "ffab2f8"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90}, "_id": "4f46f91"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "heading", "elType": "widget"}], "isInner": true, "elType": "container"}, {"id": "9db442d", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Una <strong>hipoteca puente con capital privado</strong> permite obtener liquidez de forma r\u00e1pida utilizando un inmueble como garant\u00eda mientras se completa una venta, se cierra una operaci\u00f3n o llega un ingreso previsto. En ProActivo Finance estudiamos operaciones en toda Espa\u00f1a con un enfoque pr\u00e1ctico, flexible y orientado a resolver necesidades reales de financiaci\u00f3n.</p><p>Cuando la banca tarda demasiado o no entiende la urgencia del caso, el <strong>capital privado</strong> puede actuar como una alternativa eficaz para empresas, inversores, promotores y propietarios con patrimonio inmobiliario. Analizamos el valor del activo, la salida de la operaci\u00f3n y la viabilidad global, no solo el historial bancario.</p><p>Si necesitas una respuesta \u00e1gil, puedes solicitar una primera valoraci\u00f3n desde <a href=\"https://proactivofinance.com/\"><strong>ProActivo Finance</strong></a> y saber si tu inmueble permite estructurar una operaci\u00f3n con <strong>firma ante notario</strong>.</p>", "paragraph_spacing": {"unit": "px", "size": 36, "sizes": []}, "text_color": "#FFF6F6", "link_color": "#FFF6F6", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "20", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "__globals__": {"link_color": "", "link_hover_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary"}, "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50}, "_id": "cd877dd"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90}, "_id": "528c8eb"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "text-editor", "elType": "widget"}, {"id": "02dba72", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}}, "elements": [{"id": "d8069a2", "settings": {"title": "\u00bfQu\u00e9 es una hipoteca puente con capital privado?", "align": "center", "typography_typography": "custom", "title_color": "#FFFFFF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50}, "_id": "82a60e3"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90}, "_id": "89a89c2"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "heading", "elType": "widget"}, {"id": "1ae7a71", "settings": {"editor": "<p>La hipoteca puente con capital privado es una financiaci\u00f3n temporal respaldada por una garant\u00eda inmobiliaria. Su funci\u00f3n es cubrir una necesidad de liquidez durante un periodo concreto, normalmente hasta que se produce un hecho previsto: la venta de un inmueble, la entrada de fondos, la cancelaci\u00f3n de una deuda o la formalizaci\u00f3n de una operaci\u00f3n empresarial.</p><p>A diferencia de una hipoteca puente bancaria, el an\u00e1lisis no se limita a criterios automatizados. En ProActivo Finance revisamos la garant\u00eda, las cargas existentes, el importe solicitado, el plazo necesario y la estrategia de salida. Esto permite valorar operaciones que pueden quedar bloqueadas en la banca por ASNEF, incidencias puntuales, falta de ingresos demostrables o urgencias registrales.</p><p>Este planteamiento es especialmente \u00fatil cuando existe una oportunidad clara, pero el cliente necesita actuar antes de que el mercado, el vendedor o una situaci\u00f3n legal avance. En operaciones similares, tambi\u00e9n trabajamos soluciones como el <a href=\"https://proactivofinance.com/prestamo-puente-con-capital-privado-en-madrid\"><strong>pr\u00e9stamo puente con capital privado en Madrid</strong></a>, adaptando el an\u00e1lisis a la ubicaci\u00f3n y al tipo de activo.</p>", "paragraph_spacing": {"unit": "px", "size": 36, "sizes": []}, "text_color": "#FFF6F6", "link_color": "#FFF6F6", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "20", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "__globals__": {"link_color": "", "link_hover_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary"}, "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50}, "_id": "d8bef06"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90}, "_id": "e0a50a0"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "text-editor", "elType": "widget"}], "isInner": true, "elType": "container"}, {"id": "e67103e", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}}, "elements": [{"id": "6127994", "settings": {"title": "\u00bfCu\u00e1ndo solicitar una hipoteca puente con capital privado?", "align": "center", "typography_typography": "custom", "title_color": "#FFFFFF", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "20", "right": "0", "bottom": "020", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50}, "_id": "88667db"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90}, "_id": "29179d4"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "heading", "elType": "widget"}, {"id": "4b66b52", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Este tipo de financiaci\u00f3n encaja cuando el tiempo es un factor cr\u00edtico y existe un inmueble que puede respaldar la operaci\u00f3n. No se trata de endeudarse sin planificaci\u00f3n, sino de utilizar el patrimonio inmobiliario para ganar margen de maniobra.</p>", "paragraph_spacing": {"unit": "px", "size": 36, "sizes": []}, "text_color": "#FFF6F6", "link_color": "#FFF6F6", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "20", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "__globals__": {"link_color": "", "link_hover_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary"}, "align": "left", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50}, "_id": "87423b2"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90}, "_id": "9a90446"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "text-editor", "elType": "widget"}, {"id": "ebcb3de", "settings": {"editor": "<ul><li>Comprar un inmueble antes de vender otro sin perder una oportunidad de mercado.</li><li>Cancelar cargas, embargos o deudas urgentes antes de que el problema avance.</li><li>Aportar liquidez temporal a una empresa con patrimonio inmobiliario.</li><li>Completar una reforma, promoci\u00f3n o inversi\u00f3n con salida prevista.</li><li>Reordenar una operaci\u00f3n inmobiliaria que la banca no resuelve a tiempo.</li></ul>", "paragraph_spacing": {"unit": "px", "size": 36, "sizes": []}, "text_color": "#FFF6F6", "link_color": "#FFF6F6", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "__globals__": {"link_color": "", "link_hover_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary"}, "align": "left", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50}, "_id": "9a8f7c8"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90}, "_id": "9cb0197"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "text-editor", "elType": "widget"}, {"id": "5d53041", "settings": {"editor": "<p>En todos estos casos, la clave est\u00e1 en definir bien el importe, el plazo y la salida. La operaci\u00f3n debe tener sentido econ\u00f3mico, una garant\u00eda suficiente y una formalizaci\u00f3n transparente.</p>", "paragraph_spacing": {"unit": "px", "size": 36, "sizes": []}, "text_color": "#FFF6F6", "link_color": "#FFF6F6", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "20", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "__globals__": {"link_color": "", "link_hover_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary"}, "align": "left", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50}, "_id": "674a881"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90}, "_id": "cd2f2ad"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "text-editor", "elType": "widget"}, {"id": "615796a", "settings": {"editor": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cada operaci\u00f3n tiene su particularidad, pero nuestra l\u00ednea de pr\u00e9stamos promotor parte de una base s\u00f3lida que adaptamos seg\u00fan el caso:</span></p>", "paragraph_spacing": {"unit": "px", "size": 36, "sizes": []}, "text_color": "#FFF6F6", "link_color": "#FFF6F6", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "20", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "__globals__": {"link_color": "", "link_hover_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary"}, "align": "left", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50}, "_id": "3d04527"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90}, "_id": "9a9718a"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "text-editor", "elType": "widget"}, {"id": "ee0806c", "settings": {"title": "Ventajas frente a la banca", "align": "center", "typography_typography": "custom", "title_color": "#FFFFFF", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "20", "right": "0", "bottom": "020", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50}, "_id": "5d57d93"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90}, "_id": "96aea80"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "heading", "elType": "widget"}, {"id": "e5f1be7", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"mi-tabla-ajustada\">\n    <table>\n        <thead>\n            <tr>\n                <th>Necesidad</th>\n                <th>C\u00f3mo ayuda el capital privado</th>\n            </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n            <tr>\n                <td><strong>Rapidez</strong></td>\n                <td>Permite obtener una respuesta \u00e1gil cuando la operaci\u00f3n no puede esperar.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td><strong>Flexibilidad</strong></td>\n                <td>Valora el inmueble, la salida prevista y el contexto del cliente.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td><strong>Seguridad</strong></td>\n                <td>La operaci\u00f3n se formaliza ante notario con condiciones claras.</td>\n            </tr>\n        </tbody>\n    </table>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n.mi-tabla-ajustada { margin: 20px 0; font-family: 'Suisse Intl', sans-serif; border: 1px solid #59819933; border-radius: 10px; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; box-shadow: none !important; }\n.mi-tabla-ajustada table { width: 100%; min-width: 500px; border-collapse: collapse; background-color: #FFFFFF; margin: 0; }\n.mi-tabla-ajustada thead th { background-color: #fcfcfc; color: #598199; padding: 12px 15px; text-align: center; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0; }\n.mi-tabla-ajustada td { padding: 12px 15px; color: #598199; font-size: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0; text-align: center; }\n.mi-tabla-ajustada td:first-child { text-align: left; font-weight: 500; }\n.mi-tabla-ajustada tr td:last-child { background-color: #f8fbff; font-weight: 600; }\n.mi-tabla-ajustada tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }\n@media (max-width: 600px) { .mi-tabla-ajustada thead th { font-size: 11px; padding: 10px; } .mi-tabla-ajustada td { font-size: 11px; padding: 10px; } }\n</style>"}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "html", "elType": "widget"}, {"id": "b70b8bd", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Adem\u00e1s, podemos estudiar operaciones con incidencias siempre que el inmueble tenga valor suficiente y exista una salida razonable. Para clientes que buscan liquidez con respaldo inmobiliario, tambi\u00e9n puede ser \u00fatil revisar opciones de <a href=\"https://proactivofinance.com/prestamos-con-garantia-hipotecaria-en-barcelona-proactive\"><strong>pr\u00e9stamos con garant\u00eda hipotecaria en Barcelona</strong></a> como referencia de estructura.</p>", "paragraph_spacing": {"unit": "px", "size": 36, "sizes": []}, "text_color": "#FFF6F6", "link_color": "#FFF6F6", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "20", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "__globals__": {"link_color": "", "link_hover_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary"}, "align": "left", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50}, "_id": "17a6c48"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90}, "_id": "e3c35e0"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "text-editor", "elType": "widget"}, {"id": "d914309", "settings": {"content_wid